  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nImagine living right in the heart of Mairangi Bay village, tucked between two of its most prestigious streets - Brighton Terrace and Montrose Terrace. Set well back from the road, this charming 1960s brick unit offers a simple, relaxed lifestyle in one of the North Shore’s most desirable beachside communities. Living here, you’ll feel like you’re on holiday every day.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless, single level living, the home is light filled and open plan. Doors from both the living area and the master bedroom open out onto a sunny, private deck, creating the ideal spot for your morning coffee, weekend barbecues, or simply unwinding after a busy day. Complementing the living space are two comfortable bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and a functional bathroom complete with a bath - a great bonus for young families. \r\n\r\nOutside, there is convenient off street parking, plenty of storage under the house, and a separate workshop shed, giving you fantastic extra space that could easily double as a dedicated work from home office, hobby room, or spot to keep the boards and beach gear.\r\n\r\nLow maintenance and practical, this solid brick beauty also offers great scope to refresh and add your own touch and value over time - making it a wonderful fit for first home buyers, downsizers, professional singles, or investors.\r\n\r\nBest of all, you can leave the car at home and be at Mairangi Bay Beach, local cafés, restaurants, bars, shops, the supermarket, and bus stops in just moments. You’re also in zone and within walking distance of sought after local schools, including Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Rangitoto College. Everything you love about coastal Kiwi living is right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThe owner is looking for a quick and easy sale before Christmas, so come and take a look - it won't last long! \r\nThe best place to park for open homes is on Penzance Road to avoid congestion on the driveway. Thank you. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note: Photos are not current - the property is tenanted, and the staging shown is no longer in place.",
